<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Philippite</book>
  <para style="h">Philippite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philippite</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philippite</para>
  <para style="mt">Philippite</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul leh Timothi, Khrist Jesu sikhate’n, Philippi khua a om misiangthou tengteng leh heutute leh Upate kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hehpihna leh lemna i Pa Pathian leh Toupa Jesu Khrist a kipan noute tung ah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noute k’on phawk tengin ka Pathian kiang ah kipahthu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na vek ua ding a kipaktak a thum a k’on ngetsakna teng ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni masapen apan tuni tanpha a Tanchinhoih a na kithuahkhawmna ziak ua kipak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai thil mahmah gingta ing: amah nou a nasep hoih panpan Jesu ni tanpha in a zoukim vek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na vek ua tungtang thu a, ken hichibang lungsim ka neih a dik ahi, ka lungtang a k’on neih ziak in; ka kolbutna leh Tanchinhoih gupna leh hihkipna thu a hehpihna ka tanpihte na hi vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khrist Jesu hehpihna nou ngiingei ah nou k’on ngai mahmah chih Pathian in a hon theihpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Noute theihna leh theihkakna toh kithuah itna a na khan semsemna ding un ka thum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi a thil hoihpen na deih ua, Khrist ni a siangthou leh dembei a na om theihna ding uh ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian thupina leh pahtawina ding a, Jesu Khrist ziak a hongom dikna gahte a dim a na om theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute aw, tuin ka tung a thil hongtungte, Tanchinhoih a khanna dia hongtung ahi uh chih na theih uh ka deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Inpi vengpawl tengteng leh a dang tengteng kiang ah Khrist a ka kolbuhna ziak a kichianta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka kolbuhna a kipan a Toupa muanna nei in unaute lak a tampite lau lou a Pathian thu gen ding in nakpitak in a hong hangsan deuhdeuhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khenkhatte’n hazatna ziak leh thangpaihna ziak in Khrist a tangkoupih ua; khenkhatte’n hoih a sak ziak un a gen uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawl khatte’n itna ziak in, Tanchinhoih dik dan gen dia om ka hihdan thei in a gen uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh pawl dang in kikhenna ding in Khrist a tangkoupih ua, a taktak hilou in ka kolbuhna a ka thuakna behlap tum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bang a poi a? Kong bangkim a Khrist a kigenkhiak phot leh, a khem hi in a taktak hileh huai ah ka kipak hi. Ahi, ka kipak zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na thumnate uh leh Jesu Khrist Kha panpihna ziak in hiai ka suahtakna hongsuak ding chih ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka gintak taktakna leh ka lametna bang in bangmah ah hihzum in ka omkei hial dia, himahleh ahi gige sa mah bang in tuin leng Khrist ka hinna hiam ka sihna hiam in ka sapum ah hangsanna kim toh hihletin a om ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei ding in zaw hin Khrist ahi a, sih leng punna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh sa a hin ka tan ding hitaleh kei din sepgim gah tampi suahna ding ahi. Himahleh ka telding ka theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nih kaltehin hamhaihin ka om hi. Paimanga Khrist kiang a om utna ka nei a; nakpitak in huai a hoih zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh noute ziak in sa a omphot a kiphamoh zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in hiai ginna ka neih ziak in, ka omphot ding chih ka thei hi; ginna a na khanletna ding uh leh na kipahna ding un, na vek ua lak ah ka omphot ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi a na kiang ua k’ong pai nawn ding ziak a Khrist Jesu na suanna ding uh tam semsem kei a na neihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na omdan uh Khrist tanchinhoih toh kituak sak photphot un; hong a, nou hong mu a, ahihkeileh ka omlouh a leng kha khat a na din kipdan uh leh lungsim khat nei a Tanchinhoih thugin a na pandan uh, na tanchin uh ka zak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan bangmah ah na melmate uh hihlau in omkei un. Huai amau ading in manna ding kichetna teltak ahi a, himahleh nou ading in hotdamna ding kichetna ahi, huai Pathian a kipan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hiai tuh nou adia phal ahita: Khrist gingtate kia hilou a, amah ziak a na thuaksam ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keimah a na muh uleh na zak uh huai kidouna mah na dou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in Khrist a thu kihilh ding a om a, itna a kinep theihna ding a om a, kha toh kithuahna, kilainatna leh kihehpihna a om leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />huai lungsim mah pu in, hichibang itna mah nei unla, tup kibang leh lungsim khat nei in ka kipahna hon hihkim sakun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kikhenna ding leh kithupisakna ziak in bangmah hih kei un; lungsim niamlak in michih in amah sang in midang hoihsa zaw hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lak ua kuapeuh in amah ading kia enlou in, midang a leng en sam hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a om hiai lungsim nei le uchin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah Pathian bang a om hinapi in, Pathian toh kikim a om thil khiaklah ding in a sepkei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh amah a hong ki awngsak a, sikha bang in a hongom a, mihing bang a bawl in a hongom hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in mihing mel a honpu a, hong kihihneu in si ding in thu a hon mang a, ahi, Kros a sihna a hong thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in Pathian in amah nakpitak in a hihlianta a, min laklak a min tungnungpen a peta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu min a mi tengteng a khukdin a, vantung, leitung leh leinuai a thil om tengteng leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />lei tengteng in Jesu Khrist Pa Pathian thupina ding a Toupa ahi a chih theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi a hih ziak in, ka itte aw, ka omlai kia hilou a, ka omlouh lai a leng thu na man theihtak mah bang un, lau leh ling kawm in na hotdamna chiat uh semkhia un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah lungtuak dia noumau a hon utsak leh hon semsakpa Pathian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dawngdawng lou leh phunphun lou in thil bangkim hih un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khangthak gilou leh khial, a lak ua khovel vak bang a na tennate lak uah Pathian ta gensiatbei leh siangthou,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinna thu taklang na hih theihna ding un; huai a kipan a ken Khrist ni a hongtun chiang a, a thawn in ka semgim kei a, a thawnin ka taigim kei ka chih ngamna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi, na ginna thillat tung ua Pathian adia buakkhiak a om ding na hi leng ka dah kei a, na vek un k’on kipahpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak mah in, nou leng kipak unla; keileng hon kipahpih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abang abang hileh na omdan uh ka theih a lungmuanga ka om theihna ding in Timothi na kiang ua honsawl pah Toupa Jesu ah ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hichibang lungsim pu a, na hoihna ding uh awlmoh midang kuamah ka neikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu Khrist thilte zong lou in, avek un amau tuam chiat a zong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh aman tuh ta in a pa nna a sep bang in Tanchinhoih genzakna ah kei a hon seppih chih theihchetna amah ah na nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in bangchi’n ka om dia chih k’on theihchet peuhpeuh chiang in amah hon sawlkhiak pah ka kilamen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh keimah mah leng ka hongpah ding chih Toupa ah ka kilamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh ka sanggam leh seppih leh sepaih pih leh na taksapna ua gamtang leh sawltak Epafrodita na kiang ua honsawl kiphamoh ka sa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na vek un a hon ngai mahmah hi, a damlouh thu na zak un, a lungkham mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Si dektak in a china ngei a; himahleh Pathian in a tung ah hehpihna a nei a; amah tung kia leng hilou in kei tung ah leng ahi sam a, huchi a lungkhamna ka neih sawnsawn louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huaiziak in amah k’on sawlteitei hi, amah na muh chiang un na kipahpih un, huchi a keileng ka dah luat louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huaiziak in kipaktak in Toupa ah amah na kipahpih unla; amah na ngaisang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khrist nasepna ah amah tuh a hong sideka, kei ding a na hihkim louhte uh hon hihsak a tupna lam ah a hinna a khuai dektak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atawppen in unaute aw, Toupa ah kipak un. A ngeimah gelh kei ading in a chimtakhuai kei a, nou ading in a hoihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uite lak ah kiveng un, na gilou semte apan kiveng un, sa atgawp mite apan kiveng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian kha a bia, Khrist Jesu suang, zeksum diktak i hi uhi, huan sapum ah suanding i neikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sapum ah suang ding chile hang kei mahmah in suanding ka neisem ding hi. Mi himhim in sapum a suanding nei a a kitheih leh ken ka neisem hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni giatni a zeksum, Israel chi, Benjamin nam, Hebru mi kholdiak, dan lam a Pharisai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Phatuamngaihna lam chi lehang saptuamte sawi; dan a diktatna lam chi lehang gensiatbei ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hihi hitaleh, thil kei adia punna peuhmah Khrist ziak in manna in ka simta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hitaktak hi, ka Toupa theihna manpha ziak in thil tengteng ka tanta hi. Khrist ka tan theihna ding in thil tengteng ninneng bang phet in ka sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah a ka om theihna ding in leh dan a kinga keimah diktatna hilou a, Khrist ginna ziak a om pen, ginna a kinga Pathian apan suak diktatna nei zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi a Amah leh a thohnawnna thilhihtheihna ka theih a, a thuaknate tanpiha, a sihna a Amah batna ka neih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bang chi hiam a misi lak a kipan thohnawnna ka ngah theih khak leh chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai tangkhin ka hi kei a, bukim khinta ka hi kei; himahleh huai mah kei a hihsak tum in ka delh teitei hi, Khrist Jesu’n kei amah a hon hihsaktak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute aw, tangkhinta in ka kingai kei a: himahleh thil khat ka hih; nunglama omte mangngilh in malama ompen ka delh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a Pathian sapna sang kipahman mu ding in phak chiamna ka delh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaiziak in i lak ua a piching deuhdeuh bek in huchibang lungsim i nei ding uh: huchi a thil peuhpeuh a lungsim dang na neih uleh Pathian in nou a hon theisak ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I hongtunna i ngahna chiang uah muanhuai in kip peuhmah ni uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Unaute aw, kei hon enton vek unla huchibanga omte zuih ding a n’on neihte uh chiamteh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tampi a om ua, a tanchin uh k’on hilhta hi, amau Khrist Kros melmate a hihdan uh tuin leng kapkawm in k’on hilh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leilam thil ngaihtuahte zaw a tawpna uh siatna ahi a, a pathian uh a gilpi uh ahi a, a thupina uh leng a daina uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I khoveng hihna uh van ah ahizaw a; huai a kipan mah in Toupa Jesu Khrist hondampa i ngak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I pumpi thulimlou amah thupina pumpi toh kibang ding in, a hon bawlthak sak ding a, thil bangkim amah thuthu a a omsak theihna thilhihtheihna in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka unau it leh ngaih, ka kipahna leh ka manglukhute aw, Toupa ah kiptak in ding un, ka itte aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Iodia ka thuhilh a, Sintikhe ka thuhilh a, Toupa a lungsim kibang pu ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi, nou leng k’on ngen hi, hakkol puakpih muanhuaite, Tanchinhoih a ka na seppih hiai numeite, Klimen leh ka naseppih dangte hinna bu a min tuangte leng na panpih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa ah kipak gige un; ka chi nawn ding hi kipak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na migitna uh mi tengteng kiang ah kithei hen, Toupa a nai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangmahlou ah mangbang kei un; himahleh thil bangkim ah, thumna ngetna, kipahthugenna toh na ngetnate uh Pathian kiang ah theihsak in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian muanna, lungsim himhim a theihzoh vuallouh in Khrist Jesu ah na lungtang leh na ngaihtuahnate uh a hon kepsak ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaikhit chiang in unaute aw, thil dik peuhmah, thil phathuai peuhmah, thil kilawm peuhmah, thil siangthou peuhmah, thil hoih peuhmah, thil minhoih peuhmah, hoihna himhim a om a, phatna ding a om leh huai thilte ngaihtuah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keimah a na thil theihte, tante, zakte leh muhte uh, huai thilte hih un. Huchi in muanna Pathian na kiang uah om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh nakpitak in Toupa ah ka kipak hi, huchi a tua kei n’on awlmohna uh a thak nawn ziak in: n’on limsak mahmah ua, himahleh hun kizen na neikei ua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Taksap ziak a hiai thu gen ka hi kei a; bangchi bang in om mah leng huai a lungkima omdan ka theikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zawn dan ka siam a, hauhdan leng ka siam, thilchih leh thil tengteng a gilvah leh gilkiala om theihna leh niang leh tasama om theihna thuguk ka thei kheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hon hihhatpa Khrist ah thil tengteng ka hihthei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi a ka mangbatna a n’on panpih ziak un na hihhoih mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nou mahmah, nou Philippite ngei in leng Tanchinhoih omtunga kipat, Masidonia gam a kipan a ka painung nou chihlouh saptuam dang kuamah in piak leh muh lam ah, honpe kei uh chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thessalonika khua ah ka taksap awng n’on huksakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thilpiak ka zon ziak ahi kei a, nou ading a gahpung ka zong ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A himhim in thil bangkim ka nei a, ka hau a; hihdim in ka om a noumau apat bangbanghiam, gimnamtui, kithoihna hoih, Pathian kipaksak, Epafrodita a kipan in ka na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai chiang in ka Pathian in Khrist Jesu thupina a hauhna bang in na taksap tengteng uh a honpe ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin Pathian leh i Pa uh kiang ah tangtawn, tangtawn in thupina om hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a misiangthou tengteng chibai hon buksak un. Ka kiang a unau omte’n leng chibai honbuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Misiangthou tengteng in chibai a honbuk uhi, Kaisar inkuanpihte ahi deuh tuam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna in hon ompih hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
